    {
      "id": "T-001",
      "family": "T",
      "statement": "界面源码的样式里不出现字面色值（hex / rgb() / hsl()），颜色一律从 token 取",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "blocker",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "all"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/shared/设计token字典.md",
        "anchor": "1. 本文件**不出现**色值（`#rrggbb` / `rgb()` / 颜色名）、px / rem / em 数值。"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "T-002",
      "family": "T",
      "statement": "样式的注入点收敛在单一消费层：界面面的源文件里没有自己注入的 `<style>`，每个面板不再各写一份样式表",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "all"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/shared/设计token字典.md",
        "anchor": "2. 线框里**不写 token**（线框只写结构与文案位），token 只出现在组件树与该屏第 9 节。"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "T-003",
      "family": "T",
      "statement": "断点不写字面值：`@media` 的宽窄屏分界只走 `--xs-size-breakpoint-wide`（1100px）的语义，样式里不出现 `min-width: 1100px` / `max-width: 700px` 这类字面 px",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "all"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/shared/设计token字典.md",
        "anchor": "、px / rem / em 数值。"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
